  "title": "Tilapia de Jonghe",
  "description": "De Jonghe sauce is the ultimate quick and easy accompaniment to tilapia, made with Dijon mustard, butter, and garlic and simply poured over the fish before baking.",
  "authors": [
    "LaDeeVah"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-12T21:42:03-04:00",
